Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 11:54:42 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ttf: read post.isFixedPitch

A monospaced release says so in post.isFixedPitch, which the reader did not
read, so its build came out proportional (PT Mono, Nanum Gothic Coding). A
fixed-pitch font now sets the post_is_fixed_pitch value; a proportional font's
0 is the default and is left unstated.

Assisted by an AI agent (Claude Opus 5.5)
---
 babelfont/resources/ttf/DuplicateNames.ttf | Bin 772 -> 772 bytes
 babelfont/resources/ttf/make_fixtures.py   |   4 ++--
 babelfont/src/convertors/ttf.rs            |  11 +++++++++++
 3 files changed, 13 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/babelfont/resources/ttf/DuplicateNames.ttf b/babelfont/resources/ttf/DuplicateNames.ttf
index f59b5a154cb1d5802bbbd8b31f7f4f0ca6107c47..02ed3eeb1a16ed7b8adcc0c1e2b5aa1aea784075 100644
GIT binary patch
delta 38
